  {
   "id": "nexoria-dungeon-rogue-heroes-128859@0.4",
   "gameId": "nexoria-dungeon-rogue-heroes-128859",
   "displayName": "Update 0.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-11-07T17:55:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New update for you to be more interesting!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes in battles",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Battles take up a lot of time, and that's not bad for a roguelike. However, when one battle takes several tens of minutes to cast a monotonous attacks, it becomes boring. I've read people's feedback and made some important changes in the combat process.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The amount of health of heroes and enemies is reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now every HP counts, and attacks become more dangerous, as well as spells. Any strike can be fatal, so keep an eye on your opponents' weaknesses. This has resulted in a rebalancing of spells and treatment potions, which now restore less health.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mana points are now given more often, once a second.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This allows you to cast spells more often than ever before, and not just to use default attacks endlessly. However, keep in mind that enemies can now use spells more often as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Animation of the attack is accelerated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "People have asked for a fast-track option, but I have decided that the attack animation should be accelerated in general, not only in the fast-track mode. You can still speed up the fight even more by holding down Ctrl.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes in dungeon",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The research mode also has its own problems, and I would like to answer the frequent question: \"Why are the needs being wasted, even if the heroes are just pushing against the wall? The answer is simple - I would like to make players more thoughtful about their movements, and trying to memorize the map, or even sketch it, so as not to bump into walls and previously visited places. Do not try to get to the end as quickly as possible. This game is not about rushing. And now about the update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the chances of getting some events in the dungeon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It so happens that although I have added a lot of new events, they were hardly noticed, because the chance of their falling out was extremely small. I fixed it and added a couple of new events to make you have more fun. You can even find a robot from IN-VERT, I hope you can do it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition, various bugs were also fixed, for example, when deleting each item gave you a point of knowledge. Points should only be given for removing spells.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you to everyone who plays and tests the game, thanks to you it will be more interesting and fun to release.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
